00:04:24.791 --> 00:04:30.471
the morning, mountain time. On immigration, Smith points voters at Quebec. In 1991, that

00:04:30.471 --> 00:04:35.231
province won a deal with Ottawa for exclusive control over picking incoming economic migrants.

00:04:35.691 --> 00:04:40.211
She wants a version of that carve-out. She said Alberta has to be involved at the very beginning

00:04:40.211 --> 00:04:43.971
